{"3726380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Curse of Tethria", "steam_appid": 3726380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight foes with fun action combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/db7e3a9e1d809076c80df55257e72e8d.poster.avif?t=1771425690\" width=1170 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/db7e3a9e1d809076c80df55257e72e8d.webm?t=1771425690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/db7e3a9e1d809076c80df55257e72e8d.mp4?t=1771425690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your enemies with not only your sword and shield, but the tools you find and items from the environment. Position yourself wisely and attack at the right moment to catch enemies off guard. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore dungeons to grow your toolkit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/059e6ca2eece37f595e1810847376548.poster.avif?t=1771425690\" width=1170 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/059e6ca2eece37f595e1810847376548.webm?t=1771425690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/059e6ca2eece37f595e1810847376548.mp4?t=1771425690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5 themed dungeons on a hand-built map. Solve puzzles along the way to find keys to any locked doors. Discover the items each dungeon hides and defeat the boss. Use what you find to gain access to new secrets and areas of the map. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rise from the grave and defeat the Cursed King</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/e0ddb8f06c35b96d886d102cb4993ff4.poster.avif?t=1771425690\" width=1170 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/e0ddb8f06c35b96d886d102cb4993ff4.webm?t=1771425690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/e0ddb8f06c35b96d886d102cb4993ff4.mp4?t=1771425690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tethria is a land cursed to bear an evil king's return. When this Cursed King returns a divine hero always rises to push him back. In the current age the Cursed King's army has gathered outside Tethria's gates, but no hero has appeared to challenge him. The brave soldiers of Tethria steel themselves, but their defeat is inevitable. Can a champion rise from the ashes and gain the power needed to defeat the Cursed King?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight foes with fun action combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/db7e3a9e1d809076c80df55257e72e8d.poster.avif?t=1771425690\" width=1170 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/db7e3a9e1d809076c80df55257e72e8d.webm?t=1771425690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/db7e3a9e1d809076c80df55257e72e8d.mp4?t=1771425690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your enemies with not only your sword and shield, but the tools you find and items from the environment. Position yourself wisely and attack at the right moment to catch enemies off guard. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore dungeons to grow your toolkit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/059e6ca2eece37f595e1810847376548.poster.avif?t=1771425690\" width=1170 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/059e6ca2eece37f595e1810847376548.webm?t=1771425690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/059e6ca2eece37f595e1810847376548.mp4?t=1771425690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5 themed dungeons on a hand-built map. Solve puzzles along the way to find keys to any locked doors. Discover the items each dungeon hides and defeat the boss. Use what you find to gain access to new secrets and areas of the map. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rise from the grave and defeat the Cursed King</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/e0ddb8f06c35b96d886d102cb4993ff4.poster.avif?t=1771425690\" width=1170 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/e0ddb8f06c35b96d886d102cb4993ff4.webm?t=1771425690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/e0ddb8f06c35b96d886d102cb4993ff4.mp4?t=1771425690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tethria is a land cursed to bear an evil king's return. When this Cursed King returns a divine hero always rises to push him back. In the current age the Cursed King's army has gathered outside Tethria's gates, but no hero has appeared to challenge him. The brave soldiers of Tethria steel themselves, but their defeat is inevitable. Can a champion rise from the ashes and gain the power needed to defeat the Cursed King?</p>", "short_description": "Explore dungeons, avoid traps, fight monsters and progress through a hand-crafted world. Defeat your enemies with action combat using your sword and shield, the tools you find and items from the environment. Can you overcome these challenges to end the curse and restore the world from evil?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“The Curse of Tethria is a confident, well-crafted action-adventure that understands the appeal of steady progression and thoughtful design. It doesn’t chase trends or inflate itself with unnecessary systems. Instead, it delivers a focused experience rooted in exploration, deliberate combat, and the satisfaction of becoming stronger through effort.”<br>4/5 – GameCritix<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/810d610333a6c4aea6428bebb7dabfb8a1ef72d1/header.jpg?t=1771425690", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/904d42c7f147569a9065a448711308684e494b56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771425690", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/904d42c7f147569a9065a448711308684e494b56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771425690", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz